      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Diamantes is far more dreadful\r\nthan one could expect. \r\nFrom within the Sealed Sepulcher,\r\nhe commands his lackeys, indulging his desires.",
        "Jp" : "ディアマンテスは想像以上に恐ろしい男だ\r\n《封じの玄室》の中から手先を使って\r\n好き放題――"
