      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 44,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "In addition, the seal is weakened from a lack\r\nof proper management.",
        "Jp" : "しかも、封印は管理が行き届かずに\r\n弱体化している"
